# Arbitration coverage — forms with a recorded reference verdict.
# Regenerate with `cargo xtask coverage --write`.
# A drop here means a change stopped arbitrating something; say why
# in the commit, and record the debt if it is not being recovered now.
# Below 100% is not automatically wrong: the 8039 forbids the four
# BUS-port ops its ROM-less bus is committed to, and the audit skips
# them deliberately. What matters is the number not falling.
1802	255/255	100.0%
2650	245/245	100.0%
6502	151/151	100.0%
6800	197/197	100.0%
65816	270/270	100.0%
8039	210/214	98.1%
8048	214/214	100.0%
8080	244/244	100.0%
F8	253/253	100.0%
SC/MP	121/121	100.0%
TMS7000	203/203	100.0%
Z80	704/704	100.0%
huc6280	234/234	100.0%
sm83	504/504	100.0%
